This repository is a set of *user* configuration files for Omarchy. It is not
Omarchy itself.

Omarchy is created by David Heinemeier Hansson and the Omarchy / Omacom team.
Omarchy is licensed separately (MIT). See:

  https://github.com/omacom/omarchy
  https://omarchy.org

Portions of the shipped plugins were cloned from Omarchy's first-party shell
plugins (`omarchy.bar`, `omarchy.network`) via `omarchy plugin clone` and may
retain Omarchy authorship metadata in their manifests.
